{"author": "raymond91125", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:0035751 regulation of lysosomal lumen pH \nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/29164\n\nconsider\nlysosomal lumen acidification GO:0007042\nlysosomal lumen pH elevation GO:0035752\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1cKl0SpGW2fW-GGqNPmzMd1t1lx6voeCCRfpGA7LCZys/edit?gid=0#gid=0\n\nImpacted groups: \nUniProt 6 -done\nFlyBase 1\nMGI 1\nUCL 1 - done\n\n** Group contacts: https://github.com/geneontology/go-site/blob/master/metadata/group-contacts.csv\n----\n\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \nNone\n\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2026-01-14T01:39:47Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Review annotations to GO:0035751 regulation of lysosomal lumen pH", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2026-01-27T01:40:57Z"}
